    "detailed_description": "<h1>Community</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2252330/extras/a728970cc7945f96e16114945b54e063.poster.avif?t=1721126313\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2252330/extras/a728970cc7945f96e16114945b54e063.webm?t=1721126313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2252330/extras/a728970cc7945f96e16114945b54e063.mp4?t=1721126313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Join the ranks of the Clicker Guardians in this thrilling idle clicker. Together with warriors, mages and rogues, you\u2019ll embark on an epic journey to save the realm from an ancient evil. You\u2019ll battle hordes of monsters and powerful bosses using a variety of weapons and abilities. It all starts with a single click!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2252330/extras/5fffce4d0511e205e33fbf9c08d4c50e.poster.avif?t=1721126313\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2252330/extras/5fffce4d0511e205e33fbf9c08d4c50e.webp?t=1721126313\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><strong>Plays Like a Clicker, Feels Like an RPG</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2252330/extras/6bfe41f5b8d75a5392536e3efe40d946.poster.avif?t=1721126313\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2252330/extras/6bfe41f5b8d75a5392536e3efe40d946.webp?t=1721126313\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2252330/extras/3a9560973c2345c460b962fade7219df.poster.avif?t=1721126313\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2252330/extras/3a9560973c2345c460b962fade7219df.webm?t=1721126313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2252330/extras/3a9560973c2345c460b962fade7219df.mp4?t=1721126313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Amass mountains of gold, resources and experience which can be reinvested in your character and companions. Make use of the free crafting system to get your hands on the rarest of items.<br>You\u2019ll be spoiled for choice on what to upgrade next.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2252330/extras/5fffce4d0511e205e33fbf9c08d4c50e.poster.avif?t=1721126313\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2252330/extras/5fffce4d0511e205e33fbf9c08d4c50e.webp?t=1721126313\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><strong>Your Unusual Usual Enemies</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2252330/extras/6bfe41f5b8d75a5392536e3efe40d946.poster.avif?t=1721126313\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2252330/extras/6bfe41f5b8d75a5392536e3efe40d946.webp?t=1721126313\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2252330/extras/7b3d93035f914a919c9be5ce820cd77d.poster.avif?t=1721126313\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2252330/extras/7b3d93035f914a919c9be5ce820cd77d.webm?t=1721126313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2252330/extras/7b3d93035f914a919c9be5ce820cd77d.mp4?t=1721126313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Encounter lots of interesting fantasy monsters, all reimagined in a unique voxel look. Turn them to dust by fighting them yourself or lean back and let your fellow Guardians do the job.<br>Clicker Guardians equally supports active and passive playstyles.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2252330/extras/5fffce4d0511e205e33fbf9c08d4c50e.poster.avif?t=1721126313\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2252330/extras/5fffce4d0511e205e33fbf9c08d4c50e.webp?t=1721126313\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><strong>Enough Content to Click for a Lifetime</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2252330/extras/6bfe41f5b8d75a5392536e3efe40d946.poster.avif?t=1721126313\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2252330/extras/6bfe41f5b8d75a5392536e3efe40d946.webp?t=1721126313\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2252330/extras/8382b8476aba06076f6aea87241a2405.poster.avif?t=1721126313\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2252330/extras/8382b8476aba06076f6aea87241a2405.webm?t=1721126313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2252330/extras/8382b8476aba06076f6aea87241a2405.mp4?t=1721126313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Progress through a plethora of stages and ascend the ranks of your guild to fight increasingly powerful bosses.<br>Guardians never sleep, as there is always a new quest around the corner!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2252330/extras/5fffce4d0511e205e33fbf9c08d4c50e.poster.avif?t=1721126313\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2252330/extras/5fffce4d0511e205e33fbf9c08d4c50e.webp?t=1721126313\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><strong>Unlock Content in Hometown</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2252330/extras/6bfe41f5b8d75a5392536e3efe40d946.poster.avif?t=1721126313\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2252330/extras/6bfe41f5b8d75a5392536e3efe40d946.webp?t=1721126313\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2252330/extras/09e7e743d495ff153dfa2bd0c8e56dea.poster.avif?t=1721126313\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2252330/extras/09e7e743d495ff153dfa2bd0c8e56dea.webm?t=1721126313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2252330/extras/09e7e743d495ff153dfa2bd0c8e56dea.mp4?t=1721126313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Dive deep into the heart of your hometown as you unlock exciting new content. Craft powerful weapons and armor to become an unstoppable force. Upgrade your skills and enchant your gear in the magical forge to reach new heights of power.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2252330/extras/5fffce4d0511e205e33fbf9c08d4c50e.poster.avif?t=1721126313\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2252330/extras/5fffce4d0511e205e33fbf9c08d4c50e.webp?t=1721126313\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><strong>Feature Overview</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2252330/extras/6bfe41f5b8d75a5392536e3efe40d946.poster.avif?t=1721126313\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2252330/extras/6bfe41f5b8d75a5392536e3efe40d946.webp?t=1721126313\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Reliable companions<br></li><li>Customizable loadouts<br></li><li>Craftable equipment<br></li><li>Individual skill trees<br></li><li>Incremental difficulty levels<br></li><li>Seasonal events<br></li><li>Special dungeons</li></ul>",
